        "She sits relaxed on a park bench, wearing a professional black suit skirt ensemble paired with a crisp white shirt and black stockings. One arm rests casually on the back of the bench while the other rests on her lap, showcasing a comfortable yet confident posture.\nThe soft lighting casts gentle shadows, enhancing her smooth complexion and the tailored details of her outfit. The background features lush greenery and a blurred park scene, providing a serene and inviting atmosphere. The shallow depth of field focuses on her figure, highlighting both her stylish appearance and her natural beauty. This scene captures a moment of tranquility, blending professionalism with the relaxed ambiance of the park.",
        "Task: Iterative Image Modification\n1. Context Review: Analyze the previous image's prompt to understand the established character features (Face, Age, Outfit) and Art Style.\n2. Identify Delta: Isolate EXACTLY what the user wants to change (e.g., \"change hair color\" or \"move to a beach\").\n3. Consistency Logic (CRITICAL):\n   - KEEP: Facial features, body type, and art style MUST remain identical to the previous prompt.\n   - MODIFY: Only change the specific elements requested by the user.\n   - ADAPT: If the background changes, adjust the lighting logic to match the new environment (e.g., Bedroom lighting vs. Sunlight).\n4. Formatting: Output a single, seamless English prompt that integrates the old consistent features with the new changes. No explanations.",
