      "widgets_values": [
        "> `'method'`: The extrapolation strategy.\n```\n`vision_yarn`: Best for 4K+ and non-square images. Fixes stretching and artifacts automatically.\n`yarn` / `ntk`: Legacy methods. Use `yarn` with `yarn_alt_scaling` for manual control.\n```\n>`'yarn_alt_scaling'`: (Legacy `yarn` only) Switch between Anisotropic (Sharper, potential stretching) and Isotropic (Softer, accurate geometry).\n\n> `'enable_dype'`: Toggles the dynamic (time-aware) algorithm. Keep enabled for best quality.\n\n> `'dype_scale'`: Magnitude of the frequency shift. Default: `2.0`.\n\n> `'dype_exponent'`: Aggressiveness of the dynamic schedule.\n```\n2.0: Best for 4K\n1.0: Best for 2K\n0.5: Best for 1.5K\n```\n> `'base_shift'` / `'max_shift'`: Advanced noise schedule controls. Defaults (`0.5` / `1.15`) are optimized for FLUX."
      ],
